loading_*.png

# voxel_harness writes its captures to --out-dir, which defaults to the working directory, and
# the harness must be RUN FROM THE REPO ROOT so dev/scenarios and dev/goldens resolve. So a plain
# `voxel_harness --scenario X` drops <backend>_<capture>.png here every time. They are
# regenerable outputs, never sources -- a capture worth keeping is copied into research/captures/
# under a name that says what it shows. Anchored to the root so research/captures/ is unaffected.
/vk_*.png
/d3d12_*.png
